*  M_dp_lo_neg -  nfet_03v3  IS MISSING !!!!
*  M_dp_lo_b_pos -  nfet_03v3  IS MISSING !!!!
*  M_dp_lo_b_neg -  nfet_03v3  IS MISSING !!!!
*  M_rf_pos -  nfet_03v3  IS MISSING !!!!
*  M_rf_neg -  nfet_03v3  IS MISSING !!!!
*  R_load_2 -  ppolyf_u_1k  IS MISSING !!!!
*  R_load_1 -  ppolyf_u_1k  IS MISSING !!!!
.ends


