.subckt 5tota Vdd_3v3 Vout_5tota Vin_p_5tota Vin_m_5tota VSS Ibias_30uA_nmos
*.ipin Vdd_3v3
*.ipin Vin_p_5tota
*.ipin Vin_m_5tota
